        _position: {x: 120, y: 100}
        _size: {x: 360, y: 280}
        _tags:
        - overview
        - team
        - knowledge
        _isPinned: 1
        _overview: Rebuild the legacy asset into a UPM-first planner that is easier to understand, easier to extend, and strong enough to demo on its own.
        _teamSnapshot: Product Design, Tools Engineering, Documentation, Launch Producer
        _projectKnowledge: Keep planning as the headline, keep extensibility public but advanced, and use this board to prove that the package can carry real internal rollout work.
